        {"english": "vessels", "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "ZIZOP", "pronunciation": "Zizop."}}, "note": "followed by \"Zod lida\" and \"It is a Word and a Letter\" (p.120)", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 191, "leaf": 280, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 120, "leaf": 209, "field": "enochian"}]},
