        {"english": "hath planted", "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "HARG", "pronunciation": "argenton. / Harg."}}, "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 190, "leaf": 279, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 122, "leaf": 211, "field": "enochian"}]},
        {"english": "a Torment", "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "MIR", "pronunciation": "Mir."}}, "note": "Casaubon then prints PIZIN (\"Pizin.\") and, after BABALON, \"Put out the last Pilzin.\"; PIZIN is not a row", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 190, "leaf": 279, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 122, "leaf": 211, "field": "enochian"}]},
