        {"english": "comfort.", "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "BLIOR", "pronunciation": "Bli or."}}, "note": "then \"A voyce. The end of that. Δ. This is the fifth of this day.\"", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 191, "leaf": 280, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 130, "leaf": 219, "field": "enochian"}]}
