    {
      "key": 10,
      "casaubonCall": 6,
      "dictated": "Saturday 14 May 1584, Cracow (\"Saturday, 14 Maii, Mane hora 6 Fere. Cracoviae\", p.118 n207); Keys 5-10 are the first to sixth Calls of that morning (p.129 \"This is the fifth of this day\", p.133 \"This is the sixth\")",
      "note": "p.133 \"The end of that Call. Δ. This is the sixth.\"; p.192 margin \"Δ 6 / 10\" English given: Thursday 5 July 1584, Cracow (\"Thursday, Cracoviae, Julii 5. Mane, hora 8. fere\", p.189 n278) (p.192, given in two showings with a cloud between). Casaubon prints the English in the order received, in two showings: (1) \"The Thunders of Judgement and wrath ... laid up for the earth, that times 5678. in the 24th. parte of a moment roar with an hundred mighty Earth-quakes. And a Thousand surges which rest not [or] labour still, neither know.\" (2) \"Which burn night and day. And vomit out ... with poyson. These be the Thunders any time here. One rock bringeth out a thousand ... your noyses.\" Rows follow the Enochian, so rows 20-34 (\"Which\" .. \"the Thunders\") take parcels from the second showing and rows 35-50 from the first, and \"any time here\" (second showing) follows \"know.\" (first). Within the first showing \"Neasts / 22.\" and \"times / 5678.\" are in the English order, not the Enochian (OP VIRQ, DAOX COCASG). Three Dee words have no English parcel in Casaubon (the second COCASG, PLOSI, MATORB: english null); one English parcel, \"a thousand\" after \"bringeth out\", has no caps entry and takes MATB from Nalvage's note",
      "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 192, "leaf": 281, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 130, "leaf": 219, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 131, "leaf": 220, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 132, "leaf": 221, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 133, "leaf": 222, "field": "enochian"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 192, "leaf": 281, "field": "enochian"}],
      "checked": {"date": "2026-11-10", "works": ["casaubon1659"], "covered": ["enochian", "english"], "notCovered": ["Sloane MS 3191, Dee's own copy, whose images are offline", "a second reading of every word (a random quarter was read twice)", "the words Casaubon's print has damaged", "the Golden Dawn's reading"]},
      "rows": [
        {"english": "The Thunders of Judgement and wrath.", "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "CORAXO", "pronunciation": "Co rax o."}}, "note": "Casaubon prints this English line as a heading over the three columns", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 192, "leaf": 281, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 130, "leaf": 219, "field": "enochian"}]},
        {"english": "are", "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "CHIS", "pronunciation": "Chis."}}, "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 192, "leaf": 281, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 130, "leaf": 219, "field": "enochian"}]},
        {"english": "numbred", "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "CORMP", "pronunciation": "Cormp.", "printed": "CORM."}}, "note": "DAMAGED. Caps \"CORM.\"; P from the pronunciation \"Cormp.\"", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 192, "leaf": 281, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 130, "leaf": 219, "field": "enochian"}]},
        {"english": "and", "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "OD", "pronunciation": "Od."}}, "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 192, "leaf": 281, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 130, "leaf": 219, "field": "enochian"}]},
        {"english": "are harboured", "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "BLANS", "pronunciation": "Blans."}}, "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 192, "leaf": 281, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 131, "leaf": 220, "field": "enochian"}]},
        {"english": "in the North,", "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "LUCAL", "pronunciation": "Lu cal.", "printed": "...U....AL"}}, "note": "DAMAGED. Caps \"...U....AL\"; L, C from the pronunciation \"Lu cal.\"", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 192, "leaf": 281, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 131, "leaf": 220, "field": "enochian"}]},
        {"english": "in the likenesse", "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "AZIAZOR", "pronunciation": "A zi a zor.", "printed": "AZI.....R"}}, "note": "DAMAGED. Caps \"AZI.....R\"; A, Z, O from the pronunciation \"A zi a zor.\"", "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 192, "leaf": 281, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 131, "leaf": 220, "field": "enochian"}]},
        {"english": "of an Oak,", "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "PAEB", "pronunciation": "Pa eb."}}, "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 192, "leaf": 281, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 131, "leaf": 220, "field": "enochian"}]},
        {"english": "whose", "readings": {"casaubon1659": {"word": "SOBA", "pronunciation": "So ba."}}, "sources": [{"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 192, "leaf": 281, "field": "english"}, {"work": "casaubon1659", "page": 131, "leaf": 220, "field": "enochian"}]},
